<title>UK: BankAmerica sets $500 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica sets $500 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and PaineWebber.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKAMERICA CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	SPREAD     10 BP     MATURITY	*SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    26.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.967    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.967</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AT PAR FROM SEPTEMBER 1999</p>
<p> LISTING   LUX	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW   CALIFORNIA HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10	  SELL CONC  7.5	 PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
